---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Vol.01 P5｜Glass Core｜J 的世界 Research">

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-inner">
    <div class="kicker">RESEARCH · VOL.01 · P5</div>
    <h1>Glass Core：結果，而不是起點</h1>
    <p>Glass → TGV → Core Substrate → Advanced Packaging</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div>
      <div class="kicker">GLASS CORE</div>
      <h2>為什麼 Glass Core 值得研究？</h2>
    </div>
  </div>

  <article class="card">
    <p>
      Glass Core 不應只被理解為單一材料題材。
      它更值得放在 AI 封裝尺寸、密度與訊號完整性
      持續提升的背景下觀察。
    </p>

    <p>
      當封裝朝更大尺寸、更高 I/O 密度與更高頻高速訊號發展，
      Core Substrate 本身也可能成為值得研究的技術節點。
    </p>
  </article>
</section>

<section class="feature">
  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <div class="kicker">TECHNOLOGY PATH</div>
        <h2>Glass Core 技術路徑</h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <article class="map-card">
      <div class="map-flow">
        <span>Glass</span>
        <b>→</b>
        <span>TGV</span>
        <b>→</b>
        <span>Metallization</span>
        <b>→</b>
        <span>Glass Core</span>
        <b>→</b>
        <span>Advanced Packaging</span>
        <b>→</b>
        <span>AI Accelerator</span>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="grid">

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">01 · MATERIAL</span>
      <h3>Glass</h3>
      <p>玻璃材料的厚度、平坦度、熱特性與加工能力。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">02 · VIA</span>
      <h3>TGV</h3>
      <p>Through-Glass Via 是 Glass Core 技術路徑的重要環節。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">03 · PROCESS</span>
      <h3>Metallization</h3>
      <p>孔洞與表面金屬化直接影響電氣與可靠度。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">04 · INTEGRATION</span>
      <h3>Core Substrate</h3>
      <p>真正關鍵在於能否與後續封裝製程整合。</p>
    </article>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <article class="card">
    <span class="tag">WATCH</span>
    <h3>Glass Core 的四個驗證點</h3>
    <p>
      技術驗證 → 製程整合 → 良率 → 客戶導入與量產。
    </p>
    <p>
      只有當這些節點逐步被公開資訊支持，
      技術題材才真正轉化為產業價值。
    </p>
  </article>
</section>

<section class="cta">
  <div class="cta-inner">
    <div>
      <div class="kicker">NEXT · P6</div>
      <h2>技術節點如何轉換成產業觀察？</h2>
      <p>建立 Investment Matrix。</p>
    </div>
    <a class="button" href="/research/vol01/p6">閱讀 P6 →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .map-flow {
    padding:18px;
    border:1px solid #2b394a;
    border-radius:12px;
    background:#0b1119;
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
  }

  .map-flow span {
    padding:5px 8px;
    border:1px solid #354457;
    border-radius:6px;
    background:#121c28;
    font-size:13px;
  }

  .map-flow b { color:#7188a0; }

  @media(max-width:800px) {
    .map-flow b { display:none; }
  }
</style>

</BaseLayout>
